   "id": "lead-1",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "Nikolai Konstantinovich Sudzilovsky (December 15, 1850 – April 30, 1930, also known as Nicholas Russel and Kauka Lukini) was a revolutionary and scientist.",
